{
  "id": "druid-halcyon-druid",
  "name": "Halcyon Druid",
  "classId": "druid",
  "summary": "Though they revere the natural world, halcyon druids are less focused on emulating its inhabitants. Instead, like Old-Mage Jatembe, they treat with beings from the Outer Sphere.",
  "replacesText": "Nature Bond; Nature Sense; Class Skills; Wild Empathy; Spontaneous Casting; Wild Shape; Resist Nature's Lure; A Thousand Faces",
